### Case: order-passthrough — the same JSON body sent as text/plain.
### Expect 200, and the body forwarded UNCHANGED. text/plain is not in
### request_content_types, so the transform does not run and does not complain.
### This silent passthrough is the failure mode to design alerting around.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/catalog/orders
content-type: text/plain
accept: application/json

{"orderId":"SO-1"}
